    "Available Sizes (UK)": "UK 2.5, UK 3, UK 3.5, UK 4, UK 4.5, UK 5, UK 5.5, UK 6, UK 6.5, UK 7, UK 7.5, UK 8, UK 8.5, UK 9, UK 9.5"
