  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Your daily runs just became more enjoyable! Introducing the Nike Vomero Plus—everyday runners that take maximum cushioning to the next level. Featuring a mountainous stack of full-length ZoomX foam, the most responsive foam in the industry, these ultra-light sneakers let you zoom past your running goals in absolute comfort. The high-abrasion rubber outsole offers a firm grip, delivering the optimum traction required for a safe and effective run. It’s time to go the extra mile and redefine your limits with the Nike Vomero Plus!</p> <p><strong>Nike Vomero Plus features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Engineered mesh upper offers soft breathability.</li> <li>Webbed lace loops provide an adjustable fit.</li> <li>Reflective hits along the toe and heel improve low-light visibility.</li> <li>Weight: 8.1 oz.</li> <li>Heel-to-toe drop: 10 mm.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Soft landings make every mile feel smoother in the Nike Vomero Plus, a max-cushion runner built for daily training, long walks, and all-day comfort. Full-length ZoomX foam creates a plush, responsive ride, while the engineered mesh upper keeps the feel breathable and secure from the first step to the last.</p> <ul> <li>Engineered mesh upper for breathable comfort.</li> <li>Full-length ZoomX foam for lightweight cushioning and bounce.</li> <li>Webbed lace loops for an adjustable fit.</li> <li>Reflective hits at the toe and heel for low-light visibility.</li> <li>High-abrasion rubber outsole for durable traction.</li> <li>Weight: 8.1 oz.; heel-to-toe drop: 10 mm.</li> </ul> <p><strong>Size & Fit Guidance</strong></p> <p>Many reviewers find the fit secure and comfortable for running, walking, and long hours on foot. For the best fit, we recommend going up half a size if you prefer a little extra room in the toe box, while many others are happy in their usual size.</p> <p><strong>Best For</strong></p> <p>Best for daily runs, long-distance training, recovery miles, walking, and extended time on your feet when plush comfort is the priority.</p> <p><strong>Cushioning & Road Feel</strong></p> <p>Reviewers consistently call out the cloud-like softness, smooth bounce, and supportive feel underfoot. The high-stack platform shines on easy runs, long runs, and everyday wear, giving you a protective ride that helps keep legs feeling fresher over distance.</p> <p><strong>Break-In & Durability</strong></p> <p>Most reviewers say the comfort shows up right away, though the max-cushion feel may take a run or two to adjust to if you usually wear lower-profile shoes. Reviewers also describe the shoe as a dependable option for repeat miles and regular rotation wear.</p> <p><strong>Care & Maintenance</strong></p> <p>Spot clean the mesh upper gently and let the shoes air dry to help preserve their look and feel. Lighter colorways may benefit from quick cleanup after wear to keep them looking fresh.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Vomero Plus - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/White</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Breathable mesh upper with durable synthetic overlays and rubber traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='p